== Notes ==
* In addition to the diseases listed in the description, [[filth fever]] is a possible result of this spell.
* The [[saving throw]] is for the disease, not for this spell directly. (So the [[difficulty class|DC]] is determined solely by the disease; factors like [[spell focus]] do not apply.)
* Due to a .2da bug, ''remove disease'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

